<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-401] Autoscroll on key up/down to wrong position of the document</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-401</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Cursor can move around paragraph by up/down key of keyboard.&lt;br/&gt;
Zeppelin autoscrolls when cursor goes off the screen, but it does not manage autoscroll very well so cursor still stay in outside of screen.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I&apos;d like to improve autoscroll behavior,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Autoscroll triggers when cursor moves to top/bottom side of the notebook.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Scroll notebook to put cursor in the middle ~ 1/3 of the screen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
